Patch 59 -- export the missing NO-ISLAND WineD3D texture lifecycle.

The historical chain did not contain the production texture GL lifecycle
implemented in the working renderer source. Export this semantic diff only;
island census and dispatch code remains outside the NO-ISLAND chain.

